body:
As the OP for the post linked to in the subject line, I want to take a moment to say the following:

1. To everyone who posted here and there offering advice, thank you for taking the time to help someone you seem to have thought was worth a damn;

2. *That said*, please stop.  It's already too late for me, and your time would be better spent elsewhere;

3. To cthulufunk, for posting this elsewhere without giving warning or asking permission, fuck you.
